OL,3,AInvestigation after 'hundreds' of
OL,4,Aletters found dumped
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation after "hundreds" of
OL,8,Fundelivered letters were "discarded" on
OL,9,Fa country road.
OL,11,FThe SDLP MLA, Mark H Durkan, said an
OL,12,Festimated 400 unopened letters were
OL,13,Fhanded in to his office after being
OL,14,Ffound "dumped" in the Mobuoy area,
OL,15,Foutside Londonderry, on Wednesday.
OL,17,FMany were bundled together with elastic
OL,18,Fbands and included correspondence from
OL,19,Fhealth trusts and banks to addresses in
OL,20,Fthe Derry area.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
